# Malachite keeps only hub.toml in Git; the rest of .malachite/ is per machine
**/.malachite/*
!**/.malachite/hub.toml
stations/*/build/
*.tmp
# what the apps export (an FMU, a linear model, a gain): made again from the hub. The results the
# study reads are committed on purpose; delete this line to track every out/ file
out/
